// TopologyViewBase is a base for an implementation of TopologyView.
//
// It declares a refusing method for every fact complete before the
// topology stage, and for none of that stage's own. The name is the stage
// whose implementations embed it rather than the stage whose facts it
// refuses, and the two are one stage apart on purpose: a base supplying
// its own stage's facts would satisfy TopologyStageFacts by method
// promotion, so the assertion below would hold an implementation to
// nothing and a fact added at this stage would compile everywhere and
// refuse only when it was read.
